# =============================================================================
# OmniChat React — Environment Variables
# =============================================================================
# The React frontend is a set of static web components: there are NO runtime
# secrets in the browser bundle. All connection details are configured per
# element attribute (server-url, bubble-color, external-token) — see the demo
# pages in /demo and the README.
#
# The only build-time switch is NODE_ENV, injected by Vite
# (see vite.base.ts — define 'process.env.NODE_ENV').

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build / dev server (Vite)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Port for `npm run dev` / `vite` (admin portal + demo pages).
# VITE_PORT=5173

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Demo defaults (optional — used by /demo pages when no attribute is set)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VITE_DEMO_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:3001
